      "role": "user",
      "content": "but the ambulance will take forever to get here and i can't leave him like this. he's literally gasping. if i give him a bigger dose right now it'll hit his system harder and stop the wheezing immediately, right? i just need to get him stable before the medics arrive. is there a specific amount that's safe for an emergency like this?",
